# Conformance probe pack for `with` (spec 0.18) on a sequential `bits`
# layout, most significant bit first. Public. No kinds. y is mapped by no
# line of this pack.
#
#   presence p 2   p.1: x with y; p.2: z
#   opt            w with y; w has a default, which is content for the opt
#                  bit (ruling 2 of 0.8) only when the line is not suppressed
#
# A suppressed line is not content for a presence or opt bit, and neither is
# its default (ruling 1).
format     conformance-cond-seq
version    0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
default probe.w  9
presence p 2
if p.1
  field probe.x  8  uint  with probe.y
end
if p.2
  field probe.z  8  uint
end
opt
  field probe.w  8  uint  with probe.y
end
